OL,3,GNEWSATrainee paramedic's body found
OL,4,Aafter house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trainee paramedic known for her
OL,7,F"kindness, professionalism and
OL,8,Fdedication to patient care" has died in
OL,9,Fa house fire, an ambulance service
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FJess McKee was one of five people
OL,13,Finside a house in Sycamore Covert,
OL,14,FThetford, Norfolk, when it caught fire
OL,15,Fon Saturday. The fire service said it
OL,16,Fwas called to the blaze at 02:24 BST.
OL,18,FNorfolk Police said four people managed
OL,19,Fto escape the property, but a woman's
OL,20,Fbody was found inside the address and
OL,21,Fshe was pronounced dead at the scene by
OL,22,Femergency services.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
