OL,3,GNEWSATrainee paramedic's body found
OL,4,Aafter house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcKee was an emergency medical
OL,7,Ftechnician based in Suffolk and was due
OL,8,Fto graduate as a qualified paramedic in
OL,9,FJanuary, the East of England Ambulance
OL,10,FService Trust (EEAST) said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
